---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const EFFECTIVE_DATE = 'September 8, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & SMS Terms — Gain Global Networking"
  description="How Gain Global Networking collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us, including our email and SMS/text messaging program terms."
>

<header class="nav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">
      <a href="/" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; text-decoration:none;">
        <img src="/assets/ggn-logo-navy.png" alt="Gain Global Networking mark" />
        <div class="wordmark">GAIN <span class="global">GLOBAL</span><br />NETWORKING</div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="/#difference">Why Gain Global</a>
      <a href="/#values">Values</a>
      <a href="/#membership">Membership</a>
      <a href="/#team">Leadership</a>
      <a href="/#apply">Guest Registration - Free</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="/#apply" class="btn btn-cta">Guest Registration - Free</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section white" style="padding-top:64px;">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 820px;">
    <div class="eyebrow on-light">Legal</div>
    <h1 style="margin-top:14px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px); font-weight:500; color: var(--navy);">
      Privacy Policy &amp; SMS Program Terms
    </h1>
    <p style="margin-top:14px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14.5px;">Effective {EFFECTIVE_DATE}</p>

    <p style="margin-top:32px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      Gain Global Networking ("Gain Global," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This page explains
      what information we collect through our guest registration form, how we use it, and — because we offer
      an optional text messaging program — the specific terms that apply to SMS communications.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:44px; font-size:22px; color: var(--navy); font-weight:600;">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      When you submit our guest registration form, we collect your first and last name, email address,
      phone number, profession, and — if you tell us — who referred you. We also record whether you opted
      in to email updates and/or SMS text messages.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:36px; font-size:22px; color: var(--navy); font-weight:600;">How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      We use this information to respond to your guest registration, tell you about our weekly meetings and
      events, and — only if you've opted in — send you email updates or SMS text messages as described below.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:36px; font-size:22px; color: var(--navy); font-weight:600;">Email Communications</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      If you check the email opt-in box on our registration form, we'll add you to our email list for meeting
      reminders, event updates, and networking news. Every email includes an unsubscribe link, and you can opt
      out at any time.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:36px; font-size:22px; color: var(--navy); font-weight:600;">SMS / Text Messaging Program</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      If you check the SMS opt-in box and provide your phone number, you agree to receive text messages from
      Gain Global Networking related to meeting reminders, event updates, and networking news.
    </p>
    <ul style="margin-top:14px; padding-left:20px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.8; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      <li>Message frequency varies.</li>
      <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
      <li>Text <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to cancel — you'll receive a one-time confirmation that you've been unsubscribed, and no further messages will be sent.</li>
      <li>Text <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at <a href="mailto:info@gainglobalnetworking.com" class="text-link">info@gainglobalnetworking.com</a>.</li>
      <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
      <li>Consent to receive SMS messages is not a condition of any purchase, membership, or event attendance.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="callout" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong>
      All other categories of information sharing described on this page exclude text messaging originator opt-in
      data and consent — this information is not shared with any third parties.
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-top:36px; font-size:22px; color: var(--navy); font-weight:600;">Information Sharing</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      We don't sell your personal information. We share it only with the service providers that operate our
      registration and communications systems on our behalf — currently Airtable (record-keeping) and Mailchimp
      (email delivery) — and, if we complete carrier registration for our SMS program, an SMS delivery provider.
      These providers act solely on our instructions and are contractually restricted from using your information
      for their own purposes.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:36px; font-size:22px; color: var(--navy); font-weight:600;">Your Choices</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      You can opt out of email at any time using the unsubscribe link in any email, and out of SMS at any
      time by texting STOP. To have your information corrected or removed entirely, email us at
      <a href="mailto:info@gainglobalnetworking.com" class="text-link">info@gainglobalnetworking.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:36px; font-size:22px; color: var(--navy); font-weight:600;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);">
      We may update this page from time to time. The effective date above reflects the most recent revision.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top:36px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color: var(--ink-faint); border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:20px;">
      This page is a plain-language summary intended to meet common carrier and TCPA disclosure expectations
      for a small organization's SMS program. It is not a substitute for review by an attorney familiar with
      your specific obligations.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="descriptor-strip">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>Give</span><span class="sep">|</span><span>Grow</span><span class="sep">|</span><span>Gain</span>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="/assets/ggn-logo-navy.png" alt="Gain Global Networking mark" style="width:28px;" />
      <div class="wordmark">GAIN <span style="color:var(--lime);">GLOBAL</span> NETWORKING</div>
    </div>
    <div class="foot-links">
      <a href="/#difference">Why Gain Global</a>
      <a href="/#membership">Membership</a>
      <a href="/#team">Leadership</a>
      <a href="/#apply">Guest Registration - Free</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-bottom">
      <span class="fine">&copy; 2026 Gain Global Networking. Visitors always welcome — no fee to attend.</span>
      <span class="descriptor">GIVE | GROW | GAIN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

</Layout>
